            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\mathrm{RB},\\ \\mathrm{RW},\\ \\mathrm{BR},\\ \\mathrm{BW},\\ \\mathrm{WR},\\ \\mathrm{WB}$.",
              "worked": "Read each path from the first marble to the second: $\\mathrm{RB},\\mathrm{RW},\\mathrm{BR},\\mathrm{BW},\\mathrm{WR},\\mathrm{WB}$. Write each outcome to the right of its terminal branch.",
